e.official.14d19694e - https://godotengine.org\nOpenGL API 3.3.0 NVIDIA 591.74 - Compatibility - Using Device: NVIDIA - NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650\n\nSame Issue on v4.6 stable\n\n### System information\n\nWindow 10 x64 Latest\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen the Script Editor is detached into its own window and then closed using the window close button, the editor crashes instead of re-attaching the Script Editor back into the main Godot editor.\n\nExpected behavior is that closing the detached Script Editor window should re-dock it into the main editor layout. Instead, the engine crashes completely.\n\nThis makes the detachable Script Editor workflow unsafe and unreliable.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open any project\n2. Open Script Editor tab\n3. Detach Script Editor into a separate window\n4. . The Script Editor opens in a separate fullscreen/native window\n5. Click the window close button (X) on the detached Script Editor window\n6. Observe crash \n \nExpected result\n- Script Editor window closes\n- Script Editor re-attaches to main editor layout\n- Editor continues running normally\n\nActual result\n- Detached Script Editor window closes\n- Entire Godot editor crashes immediately\n\nReproducibility\n- Always\n\nVersion\n- Godot 4.6.1\n- Also present in 4.6\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nSimple New Project with a script open in script editor will do.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions"